<title>USA: CapStar Hotel buys 6 hotels from Highgate.</title>
<headline>CapStar Hotel buys 6 hotels from Highgate.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON</dateline>
<text>
<p>CapStar Hotel Co. said Wednesday it has completed the acquisition of six hotels from Highgate Hotels Inc. of Dallas for $68 million in cash and $32 million in operating partnership units.</p>
<p>Capstar said the deal brings to 18 the number of hotels it has acquired since its went public in August 1996.</p>
<p>CapStar also said the two companies have agreed to work together on future hotel acquisitions.</p>
<p>CapStar's stock fell 87.5 cents to $26.625 on the New York Stock Exchange at midday.</p>
</text>
